================================================================
Title: FC2 Proxy Rule-Set
Description: 涵盖 FC2 旗下主站、博客、视频点播、内容市场、自建 ASN 网段
================================================================
--- 1. FC2 核心主域名与关键后缀 ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fc2.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fc2.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fc2blog.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fc2blog.us
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fc2web.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fc2china.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fc2cn.com
--- 2. 旗下二级服务与关联产品域名 ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,himado.in
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,say-move.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,saymove.info
--- 3. 兜底域名关键字匹配 (防止漏匹配新开二级站) ---
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,fc2
--- 4. FC2 自治域官方宣告 IP 段 (AS63210: FC2 Inc.) ---
说明：FC2 源站服务器与部分专属流媒体切片节点位于其自有 ASN 中
IP-CIDR,104.244.96.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,199.48.208.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,199.116.176.0/24,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,199.116.178.0/23,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,208.71.104.0/24,no-resolve
IP6-CIDR,2605:2c40::/40,no-resolve
